  {
   "id": "cost",
   "name": "Coverage is not a data problem. It is a time problem.",
   "items": [
    {
     "key": "cost.1",
     "kind": "Small label",
     "text": "For buyers · What origination costs"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.2",
     "kind": "Section headline",
     "text": "Coverage is not a data problem. <em>It is a time problem.</em>"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.3",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "Roughly what one buy-side team spends to get from a filtered list to a signed letter, on a single vertical."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.4",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Associate, full time"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.5",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "Mapping, outreach, qualifying. The person is $135,000 to $253,000 in total compensation, and cannot run a process at the same time."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.6",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "12 to 18"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.7",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Months to vertical depth"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.8",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "How long before a new hire knows which names are unbuyable and why, rather than adding them to the list again."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.9",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "37 to 159"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.10",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Days under exclusivity per dead deal"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.11",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "The average by buyer type, from a family office to a senior lender, plus the diligence invoices already committed."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.12",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "A dedicated search, one sector"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.13",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "The vertical already mapped, and the diligence view attached before the name reaches you. Scope agreed in writing."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.14",
     "kind": "Note",
     "text": "Compensation range compiled by a sell-side advisory firm from Glassdoor data, August 2024, for a US M&A associate, total compensation. Days under exclusivity from a lower-middle-market deal platform’s study of broken letters of intent, January 2026, averages by buyer type. The ramp figure is an estimate, not a measurement."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.15",
     "kind": "Button",
     "text": "See what one deal costs to originate"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.16",
     "kind": "Note",
     "text": "The deal coverage calculator: your numbers, nothing sent anywhere."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "breaks",
   "name": "A quarter broke on a finding outside the earnings work.",
   "items": [
    {
     "key": "breaks.1",
     "kind": "Small label",
     "text": "For buyers · Why deals break"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.2",
     "kind": "Section headline",
     "text": "A quarter broke on a finding <em>outside the earnings work.</em>"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.3",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "Seventy-five letters of intent that were signed and then collapsed. Three of the reported reasons, on one scale."
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.4",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "A finding outside the quality-of-earnings work: a license, a contract, a compliance gap, a customer concentration"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.5",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "25.3%"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.6",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "The earnings were not what was presented"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.7",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "21.3%"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.8",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "The renegotiation that followed a finding"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.9",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "14.7%"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.10",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "0%"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.11",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "30%"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.12",
     "kind": "Note",
     "text": "A lower-middle-market deal platform’s published study of broken letters of intent, January 27, 2026: seventy-five broken letters across eight buyer types and eight industries. These are three selected categories on a scale of 0 to 30 percent. They are not the full distribution and are not summed."
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.13",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "The problem"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.14",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "The solution"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.15",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Today"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.16",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "<b>Origination and diligence are two separate events</b>, run by different teams, months apart. By the time anyone looks properly the price is on the table and the leverage has already moved."
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.17",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "On a desk"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.18",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "<b>They are one process.</b> The findings that normally surface in week six of exclusivity are on the record before the name reaches you, so you are pricing against them instead of renegotiating after them."
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.19",
     "kind": "Button",
     "text": "Discuss acquisition criteria"
    },
    {
     "key": "breaks.20",
     "kind": "Note",
     "text": "Or read the cases: <a>Dead Deal Notes</a>, ten public deals and why each one ended."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "intelligence",
   "name": "What we look for when a software company adds AI features or embedd...",
   "items": [
    {
     "key": "intelligence.1",
     "kind": "Small label",
     "text": "For buyers · Intelligence"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.2",
     "kind": "Section headline",
     "text": "What we look for when a software company adds<br> <em>AI features or embedded payments.</em>"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.3",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "Two revenue lines buyers now ask about. For each, four things we trace in the records before a letter of intent."
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.4",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "01"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.5",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "AI features"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.6",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "02"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.7",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Embedded finance"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.8",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "AI features"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.9",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "How is it paid for, and do customers keep paying for it?"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.10",
     "kind": "List item",
     "text": "<i>01</i>Paid adoption"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.11",
     "kind": "List item",
     "text": "<i>02</i>Customer retention"
    },
    {
     "key": "intelligence.12",
     "kind": "List item",
     "text": "<i>03</i>Cost to deliver"
    },
    {
